Iron Legs is a monk discipline that conditions the leg muscles for
extraordinary endurance. Through countless hours of training, the monk
develops legs that can carry them much farther than ordinary travelers.

This passive skill increases the monk's movement capacity, allowing them
to travel greater distances before tiring. The conditioning also improves
the monk's stability and balance, contributing to their overall combat
effectiveness.

Iron Legs represents the monk's dedication to physical perfection and
their ability to traverse great distances in pursuit of their goals.

Class: Monk
Discipline: Iron Body

